eview-4132128283","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-17T21:09:57Z"},{"id":4133830887,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc72ZUDn","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"43de6f4d3165093bce515283b096872988aeaf5b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?u=3d42086125061f51c6b44d411da1e83c31618909&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","login":"jaydensipe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4133830887","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-18T06:27:31Z"},{"id":4134298177,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc72bGJB","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e9e341dd621c2f692b74b1ee0674878718b327b2","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"- As we've removed the reset button, perhaps there would be a way to indicate the 1.0x in the game speed list as the default, to quickly see at a glance where to click after you've set it to something else. Perhaps, if _anything but_ the 1.0x option is selected, the selected option should always be yellow in the list, and the default could be blue maybe? Just brainstorming here.\n- The mute game audio button isn't square for me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4134298177","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-18T11:56:00Z"},{"id":4134541415,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc72cBhn","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e9e341dd621c2f692b74b1ee0674878718b327b2","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?u=083ae75d5d2e2e8bbace52715ec4ac911bcf7554&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","login":"vaner-org","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org"},"body":"While here, may as well fix the odd wording (\"allow to select\") of the tooltips, with what is in the [docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/editor/game_embedding.html#interaction-mode).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4134541415","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-18T14:33:02Z"},{"id":4135437396,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc72fcRU","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"a8a9f4ad756902f7ddc731ec91642d88a9783b35","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?u=083ae75d5d2e2e8bbace52715ec4ac911bcf7554&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","login":"vaner-org","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org"},"body":"I think the info text in the big box in the middle should change, it currently says \"Press play to start the game.\" for both embeds, and for when it's disabled, it says \"Embedding is disabled.\" You can still start the game by pressing play, though. I think it could do with providing more information, scoped for the average user.\r\n\r\nHow about...\r\n- The game will run within the Game tab.\r\n- The game will run in a floating workspace.\r\n- Embedding disabled, the game will run in its own window.\r\n\r\nThe word \"embedding\" not deciding floating used to confuse me quite a lot, maybe this could make it easy.\r\nThe rest can remain as-is, although the mention of \"single window\" should become \"single-window\" as per the docs.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4135437396","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-19T03:49:40Z"},{"id":4151368736,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc73cNwg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"493e60bd5b21b4ab73d15c218fa3c8aacaa1c500","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?u=3d42086125061f51c6b44d411da1e83c31618909&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","login":"jaydensipe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4151368736","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-22T00:00:32Z"},{"id":4175552879,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc744eFv","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"6debe8ed37bbd0c966fc11c2f5906b518cebdc31","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"Added various comments on tooltips and texts to double down on reducing the technical jargon surrounding game embedding. To reiterate: users generally only experience whether the game runs embedded in the Game workspace or as a floating window, and whether it's accompanied by the toolbar or not.\n\nNot a hill I'd die on, but I'd still love it if the 1.0x option in the dropdown would be blue-tinted or something, to indicate that it's the default:\n<img width=\"156\" height=\"356\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d2d02ae-3dfe-44ec-a082-0cc581042d89\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4175552879","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-25T13:20:46Z"},{"id":4210442095,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc769j9v","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2bc403d149cf5ecb835f515dbf3aff8879887b2a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"Tested this. Didn't spot any issues, and have no more remarks. Fantastic usability improvement – excellent work @jaydensipe!\n\nDidn't look at the code.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4210442095","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-01T07:36:40Z"},{"id":4210672452,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc76-cNE","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f1108640344580be3e78fa6211dd16dca971e2d2","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?u=a1f7933340521a5903fe3cc2f8216a8c0a9565ec&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","login":"arkology","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118664#pullrequestreview-4210672452","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118664","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-01T09:15:29Z"},{"id":4210684793,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc76-fN5","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f1108640344580be3e78fa6211dd16dca971e2d2","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?u=3d42086125061f51c6b44d411da1e83c31618909&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","login":"jaydensipe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/